<title>UK: Northwest Europe oil, gas rigs unchanged at 68.</title>
<headline>Northwest Europe oil, gas rigs unchanged at 68.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of active oil and gas rigs in operation offshore Northwest Europe totalled 68 in the week ending January 22, unchanged from the previous week, consultants Arthur Andersen said.</p>
<p>U.K. rigs fell one to 34, Norway was up one at 18 and the Netherlands was unchanged at 12. Denmark was also unchanged with a total of four rigs.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 7629</p>
</text>
